 "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Mom knows my ETA thanks to Facebook.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le16ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to pick up on ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to give \u200bparticular \u200battention to something that someone has said or done", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I hope everyone is picking up on the news that I'll be there in a few short hours.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le16ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "under the table", "type": "name"}, {"content": "done in secret ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She'll be happy to see me and give me some money under the table. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le16ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "gravy train", "type": "name"}, {"content": "easy way of making money", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She retires next year - then the gravy train will stop!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le16ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "skype", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an \u200bapplication for \u200bcommunicating via the Internet using \u200bvideo or \u200bvoice \u200bcalls", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I sometime wonder why we all like to Facebook, tweet and Skype so much.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le16ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "screen time", "type": "name"}, {"content": "time spent communicating via a computer", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Face-to-face screen time is so much better. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le16ob05aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "social media ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "various \u200bprograms that \u200ballow \u200bpeople to \u200bcommunicate and \u200bshare \u200binformation on the Internet ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I just love being connected and thanks to social media, I am! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn10le16ob05aud10", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn10le16ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Other Ways of Referring to the Future", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Present Simple to express formal arrangements or dates in the future.<br/>You use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">about to</span> or <span class=\"italic\">on the point of</span> to express events in the immediate future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the  Present Simple to refer to future time actions in future time clauses.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">When I get there, we'll talk.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present Simple is also used to describe fixed events that have a clear indication of date and time. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">She retires next year.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You also use the Present Simple with various expressions.<br/><span class=\"italic\">Be about to</span>, <span class=\"italic\">be on the point of</span>, <span class=\"italic\">be due to</span>, <span class=\"italic\">just</span>/<span class=\"italic\">just about to</span> refer to a moment in the future that is very close.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">The train is on the point of leaving but I am live chatting thanks to the on-board Wi-Fi.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "She retires next year - then the gravy train will stop!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I expect dinner will be on the table when I arrive.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Expressing Possibility", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the First Conditional with <span class=\"italic\">If clauses</span> to exchange opinions about possible future outcomes.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the First Conditional to say it's possible that you will or will not do something. In that condition, something else may, may not will or will not happen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The parts of the sentence are divided into two clauses: the <span class=\"italic\">If</span> clause and the <span class=\"italic\">Condition</span> clause.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Structure: <br/><span class=\"italic\">If</span> + Present Simple/Present Perfect ... <span class=\"italic\">will</span> / Present Continuous / <span class=\"italic\">be going to</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">If I find a minute, I'm uploading the latest pictures.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If I take more this weekend, I'm putting them up on my way home. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If I haven't checked in for more than an hour, my friends are going to figure something happened to me! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I mean, if they haven't been around, I'm worrying about them! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If I get a new bigger phone this year, doing this will be even easier.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write several sentences on the good points and bad points of using social media. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Come up with 6 points for each side.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Back up each idea with an example.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice giving your opinions with the backup example.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk with a group and exchange ideas, taking turns.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Follow up on any statements you find interesting.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write several sentences on the good points and bad points of using social media. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I back up each idea with each an example.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I practice giving my opinions with the backup example.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I exchange opinions with a partner or group.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I comment further on interesting statements.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le16ob05re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn10le16ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn10le16ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "In days past, I used to hear my mother say 'When I get there, we'll talk'. That doesn't really happen anymore. My trip home is just beginning and already I'm planning my weekend. The train is on the point of leaving but I am live chatting thanks to the on-board Wi-Fi. I hope everyone is picking up on the news that I'll be there in a few short hours.", "time": "50"}, {"image": "engenn10le16ob05re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "I expect dinner will be on the table when I arrive. Mom knows my ETA thanks to Facebook. I don't doubt Gram shall arrive with her newest boyfriend in tow. I e-mail her regularly. She'll be happy to see me and give me some money under the table. She retires next year - then the gravy train will stop!\n<br>\nIf I find a minute, I'm uploading the latest pictures. If I take more this weekend, I'm putting them up on my way home. I'm tweeting everyone now. If I haven't checked in for more than an hour, my friends are going to figure something happened to me! I mean, if they haven't been around, I'm worrying about them! If I get a new, bigger phone this year, doing this will be even easier.", "time": "19000"}, {"image": "engenn10le16ob05re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "I sometimes wonder why we all like to Facebook, tweet and Skype so much. I guess we just like gabbing. Of course I also find being away at college a bit lonely. Face-to-face screen time is so much better. I feel like nothing's changed, you know?\n<br>\nGram says she used to write letters to all her friends - on paper - in the mail - with stamps! Isn't that insane!\n<br>\nI like keeping up to date too. The breaking news is always there. I get Twitter feed all the time. I just love being connected and thanks to social media, I am!", "time": "60000"}], "coverimg": "engenn10le16ob05re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about technology and personal dilemmas.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about what I will be doing or what I will have done.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express something that may be possible.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How often do you post online?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How many people do you connect with this way?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " How much do you rely on Internet exchanges to keep you up to date with your friends?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "al